      "body": "## Summary\r\n\r\nFix overlapping stores in the DeepSeek V4 XPU qnorm/RoPE KV kernel.\r\n\r\nThe KV branch previously performed a bulk store across all 512 KV\r\nelements before separately storing the rotated RoPE region. These\r\nstores overlap in the RoPE region and can result in nondeterministic\r\nKV cache contents.\r\n\r\nThe bulk store is now masked to `NOPE_DIM`, matching the existing\r\nQ-branch pattern:\r\n\r\n```python\r\ntl.store(kv_out_base + offs, kv_full, mask=offs < NOPE_DIM)",
